{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊項目，港隊於女子重劍團體賽四強，以30:14擊敗烏茲別克，晉身決賽，坐銀望金，將會與國家隊爭金牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港隊由余翠怡、林嘉雯、湯雅婷及范佩珊上陣，初段開始取得優勢，首兩節之後領先10:3，之後一直領先，並以16分距離勝出。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n男子方面，港隊於男子重劍團體賽八強，以20:30不敵烏茲別克，未能晉級，將轉戰排名賽。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:22:36.756211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:54:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:57:56.382968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:17:58.562145+00:00","content_hash":"e77f4dc64ef60d645b587fdf3b8a4bf9487f6693d5efc829587a68f1cb4d863d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}